{"id":1255,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，山西省教育厅’讲述我的育人故事”活动中，艺术学院职工创新工作室的留守儿童支教团队入选优秀案例。该团队自2019年起针对留守儿童情感缺失、学习资源不足等问题，创新开展“艺术启蒙+心理陪伴+兴趣培养”三维帮扶，累计服务儿童超千人次，用实际行动进行教学实践，此次入选，既是对团队育人成效的肯定，也是为振兴乡村教育工作提供了可借鉴的实践样本。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OMl7xPnmfkM4vinJRLPMNUDnNWfL4L0snRTknlV2UNnknzG0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVUYh2LYh7L4L8LR67MNlsU8n7LR67MznRolQ2nz9ZU8MFU4GDU8U4oRMFMRvbnzLJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvZMmlJqdanx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17865&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AECF3D33407D6E7CDD07D54C9FFE88CC/C06CD383/479E3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OoRQxVn7-ZM7V7LJlCbL49aUNl4nRC0aMRQfUmf2L46RnNC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVLSyDn1ybnmQVU4CYMmlbnR7aLzWVnN74nmviLmnRnRnFUlUDM8liMzQFnzWkM8CJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvZMmlJqdanx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17865&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=On7MxRozUPM47DMJmnVU4NYnz7bLzA0VUm7YoRnfolUaUzN0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZMkyYMYybLRCYL7Uan774nzvDLl-YnRVkL77DLRUPLmAFnRCaoRCPLmVFM7LYLzlJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvZMmlJqdanx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17865&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F842790620D0DA3E761B2D1B0A604128/D6086121/4C215\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Oo7CxsMNliU4G4UJNQkLzLDnm9PMmL0aMRUbMlUbMm9DM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfU1hfUSyiLRfVMzV2MRMVUmlbM8UanRlZM8l4nmNZo7rFnRWfL49bUmfFnlVfM49Jv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvZMmlJqdanx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17865&e=.png\"></p><p>一审：陆晨曦</p><p>二审：郭云霞</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OMl7xPnmfkM4vinJRLPMNUDnNWfL4L0snRTknlV2UNnknzG0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVUYh2LYh7L4L8LR67MNlsU8n7LR67MznRolQ2nz9ZU8MFU4GDU8U4oRMFMRvbnzLJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvZMmlJqdanx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17865&e=.png"}